flowchart TD
  A["Developer<br>(feature branch)"] -->|Create PR| B["Pull Request"]
  B --> C["CI: Validate PR<br>lint for artifact checks"]
  C --> D["Merge to dev/main"]
  D --> E["CD: GitHub Actions<br>trigger on merge or manual dispatch"]
  E --> F["Resolve target workspace &<br>environment secrets"]
  F --> G["Prepare artifacts by updating notebook metadata and replacing globally unique identifiers (GUIDs) for the target environment"]
  G --> H["Deploy to Target Workspace<br>fabric-cicd: publish_all_items()"]
  H --> N["Done"]

